# L_undo_pair_Rollup_addChallenger_removeChallenger: with NZ, after a call x of addChallenger and a call y of removeChallenger, both succeeding and restoring every register the pair restores, t observes from s2 what it observes from s
def undo_pair_Rollup_addChallenger_removeChallenger(+s: M.GSt, x: M.HAct, y: M.HAct, +t: List<&2, M.HAct>, +kh: List<&2, M.HKB>) -> Bool:
